This repository contains no game client code. It does not contain, link, embed,
or ship decompiled, disassembled, or otherwise reverse-engineered game client
material of any kind. It does not read or write game process memory, does not
inject code into the game, and does not hook or modify rendering.

The plugin only reads a local JSON file (state.json) produced by a separate,
